As with all guilds registering PK is totally an individual
choice. There is no requirement for a monk to become 
PK. It is expected that PK monks do take responsibility
for their own actions, and that the guild will not 
support them in the event they are at fault. The other
side of this being that you should protect your 
Brothers and Sisters IF they are unfairly targeted.  
